title: Fernhill F2 — dawn comes for the deedless (LOSE)
story: fernhill
continues: timeline
description: The other losing branch — do nothing all night. D1's dusk beat has
  already landed in the parent (turn 14); from there the small hours and dawn
  arrive on schedule and the auction takes Fernhill.

---

